      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17410",
      "source_sha256": "e1108c28e8e0a49a7cb433f3a7886ece861a026e304fd16d130b7a631e219dea",
      "target": "“My lady, your tea is ready. Today's selection is Russian tea.<STOP>Where shall I serve it?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17411",
      "source_sha256": "e91b4a8c98ba97a7675a11c793275e2bd5436a24a8946c708b5c96f6d68752f3",
      "target": "“...Lawrence, forget about the tea.<STOP>How much longer am I supposed to wait?!<STOP>While we sit here, those people go on committing atrocities,<STOP>and their victims keep dying in pain and bitterness!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17412",
      "source_sha256": "8fb4b6144efae73fe09885448446ee698cda23a9d9de712d47d79b53b29f7b7c",
      "target": "“My lady, our work is also vital to those who oppose the Empire.<STOP>There is information no one else can obtain.<STOP>We have access to it precisely because you belong to Romefeller.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17413",
      "source_sha256": "6f35280c10d5831f95e63b3c0c3dcde7baa788a7355e3a709e84796d2a4e66da",
      "target": "“I've heard that more times than I care to count. Let me put it another way.<STOP>How much longer must I watch the Empire's atrocities<STOP>and do nothing?!<STOP>If only the Simurgh Grandfather left me were finished...<STOP>Lawrence, you haven't...”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17414",
      "source_sha256": "0036f66009dae6f372d4ddbde974179f6fcfcb0eb30d3e04ee94d2f64904ed91",
      "target": "“Yes? What is it, my lady?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17415",
      "source_sha256": "d1e48cc44090764f61875a2c66fa7374d0a4f1364a4f03b08d6fd27c149fb2d7",
      "target": "“You haven't taken matters into your own hands out of concern for my safety,<STOP>have you?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17416",
      "source_sha256": "61987be80d927d10dc7b61421f7016cf9ac03494ba7a24c86a7171c43b0fb573",
      "target": "“Certainly not. But until we receive word from him,<STOP>we cannot act. Please be patient just a little longer.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17417",
      "source_sha256": "e6fb6c36857950b6e9f727ddfb3a479226749891e0953deafc633c3ecdadcb6b",
      "target": "“...Oh, very well.<BR>...Lawrence.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17418",
      "source_sha256": "4ac88a841fffb7c3c27f278d1df67dcfb836d0bf24c6b8b13c19495344e3a2ca",
      "target": "“Yes?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17419",
      "source_sha256": "a07dc0c43a3402a7a9dbfefa71e2a1a39ef23d470c0b873098957239ef42b1ed",
      "target": "“I'll have my tea here.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17420",
      "source_sha256": "d058d4e2a180814f9ad3dc85d6c590b17db41c1804bb1a1596b06796e6003e3d",
      "target": "“Of course, my lady.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
