      "target": "“One moment, please.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17426",
      "source_sha256": "d458623e3b2f7035194a5283461ac7c11422ef1b75a41363d79a6cb17fbb10d7",
      "target": "“Thank you for waiting. This is <G:0126><G:0126><G:0126><G:0126><G:0126>.<STOP>Mr. Banjo, I've been waiting so long to hear from you!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17427",
      "source_sha256": "7d3f1934694e522536eb47e2171faecb6a70100d1c729763c0aa20dc5c664627",
      "target": "“I'm sorry.<STOP>You've had to put up with that unpleasant work for far too long.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17428",
      "source_sha256": "74e76844ab927bb7a5e763ba1f1a87737170049beaff1cf965b0455a8abcca2b",
      "target": "“Then...?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17429",
      "source_sha256": "26d410cf8abb31e6415a675200a700acfbe71da48625e0cfe9c397f353d55867",
      "target": "“Yes. Things are finally coming together on our end.<STOP>I'm told the Simurgh's final adjustments are complete, too.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17430",
      "source_sha256": "3cccc2f2aac8e204cc95a3387817e4b7a89da02472a978542112d6c145db7286",
      "target": "“Really?! Then we're finally getting started!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17431",
      "source_sha256": "02df559ba2da89998d75861059816c875e8807762c4cb97dde25292ba33ad625",
      "target": "“That's right. Come over as soon as you're ready. I'll have Garrison send you the details.<STOP>There's someone else I need to contact now.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17432",
      "source_sha256": "f2cceb3ddd6044acef4a5b5d143a56371f02f5c62016bcf0ca935b68fd67803d",
      "target": "“Who might that be?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17433",
      "source_sha256": "629addc63cc16e4f32ba7cea41db4d9f0cedd2fcb86afae74a058aa665666bf2",
      "target": "“She's been monitoring the Empire's movements, just as you have.<STOP>She's also from Romefeller: the daughter of Duke Lefranc.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17434",
      "source_sha256": "77c9ca6853cea2e6e1e28f685c365618002e6ec925d8674be5286f796a90635c",
      "target": "“Duke Lefranc's family... You mean Lady Simone?<STOP>Come to think of it, I heard she fought the Empire three years ago<STOP>as well.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17435",
      "source_sha256": "2b8653d080a9c7607c8f679e4a6905518c5d4ab42018edceab25c152197c81b0",
      "target": "“That's right. See you soon.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17436",
      "source_sha256": "160450eda043d1a5c7a10706b695b9ef9e603954e89cdb75baeb1033d5f0baa8",
      "target": "“Mr. Banjo!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17437",
      "source_sha256": "f077ba879ba7ffde78a420599bdccb793dc22b1b9f61f7a898c7e5a6629c701e",
      "target": "“Hello! Right on time.<STOP>Simone seems to be running a little late,<STOP>so why not take a look at your machine? This way.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17438",
