      "target": "“Hmm. Truly impressive.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17442",
      "source_sha256": "2f8c3f4cf6da0cdb77a837a56801047903e6aa48c702f1000b12080b642d25f0",
      "target": "“Well, we had complete design data to work from. Otherwise, building something like this<STOP>from scratch would have been impossible. There was a joint on the back for attaching<STOP>what looked like a booster, but we modified that part of the design<STOP>and removed it.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
