      "source_sha256": "08e32b03454b6cc49e884f15386bc0dab868d209d955f449e1900c4f20c5ffd2",
      "target": "“What?!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17449",
      "source_sha256": "a30513126ab27d8820f51dc8ecd4c6772c695f148c20222ed596483d71fde748",
      "target": "“Hmm. I'll go and have a look.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17450",
      "source_sha256": "9dabd147cfa6cbe5ce1089e67759deb7777d4819ffcde896901896c47a3228d5",
      "target": "“They are indeed Imperial troops.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17451",
      "source_sha256": "21da15b040d738f0d11c84fe533dc97f17efc09a125168e5f6bde90f49f17358",
      "target": "“What are they doing out here?<STOP>I don't think they've discovered us...”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17452",
      "source_sha256": "8dd43e71d77fe6bfac9498607fb54427ebac6479b1f133b3505f50334c4fdca8",
      "target": "“They appear to be attacking the local residents indiscriminately.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17453",
      "source_sha256": "26d2bdb9058951139c004c9572ed82b85ae61fabbd28b20bbedbd29915b96194",
      "target": "“What?! ...Right.<STOP>We've heard a few reports like that lately, haven't we, Garrison?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17454",
      "source_sha256": "2a00b94dd62bc955bb1eb76c5aa2a04a8de67f1e610a33531981eadb48b8f7b2",
      "target": "“One moment, please. ...Yes, it seems the Imperial forces sometimes<STOP>conduct such operations as part of their guerrilla hunts.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17455",
      "source_sha256": "4f6d9e17ada07fe9559abcf45e108ba2d4b35c27afe1227e28ceb940c0523520",
      "target": "“How could they?! You mean they're attacking innocent people,<STOP>even the elderly and children?!<STOP>Unforgivable... I'll never forgive them!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17456",
      "source_sha256": "9146acd4a51d9ee25c4c4eba99988c0aadbcf0799c2c3d9dc5bd975d0791d12b",
      "target": "“My lady?!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17457",
