      "target": "“Daitarn, come here!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17464",
      "source_sha256": "5ca20f38511d947051970f13002514a03c483644048e1aa39e51babb98ec412d",
      "target": "“For the world and its people, I shall crush the ambitions of the Muge Zorbados Empire!<STOP>I am Daitarn 3! If you do not fear the radiance of the sun, then come at me!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17465",
      "source_sha256": "8622c2d37fcaadffc40aac1638cd145c886675f550402c73487f2facb81f4d07",
      "target": "“Oh! What a wonderful introduction. Perhaps I should think of one too.<STOP>What do you think, Lawrence?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17466",
      "source_sha256": "7e521b384e1df314a330d557851a88f8b31d6b7b1575c0335a28cec7b96f8f0e",
      "target": "“My lady, please leave that for later!<STOP>The enemy is approaching!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
