      "source_sha256": "9ced5bfbd47d64a6e35e81c52443989e3c39cb032990a4a78d688cc651326e2e",
      "target": "“...I know!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17468",
      "source_sha256": "4b24cb1c1afe1c9421057bc9ed308415b6fa9e7b072d53cf779cb79f7950dc6b",
      "target": "“Is that...? Hey, Banjo!<STOP>How did you end up fighting out here?!”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17469",
      "source_sha256": "713ff3006b7d81de7558a76231fb0429ee4adf0b79c064334683507e3050a992",
      "target": "“You're late, and that's the first thing you say?<STOP>I'll explain later. I've brought the Doll along,<STOP>and I'd appreciate a little help.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
