      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17472",
      "source_sha256": "b2ffcd739f3baf6940b54bb6f42cc51d793c446b597a82fac1f2fc4154d85183",
      "target": "“Oh, I was wondering whose unfamiliar machine that was. So it's yours.<STOP>Our courier was captured, and they found out I was passing along information.<STOP>I was already planning to come here, so the timing wasn't too bad.<STOP>But now I've got pursuers on my tail.”<END>",
