      "source_sha256": "4facd6377b3f0611f5ea3edf3aa762ca63c5be3c21f8953d241ef0056e124f4d",
      "target": "“Glad to hear it. Garrison, get us ready to move.<STOP>There's no point sitting around waiting for the enemy to find us.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17485",
      "source_sha256": "3cafe12f8b99aa43c1e5993031edf4838ba5d2b2281a225aa05b83b4dc252808",
      "target": "“Of course. Everything is already prepared.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17486",
      "source_sha256": "9fbe0cee65fa99536ce45bfe64f5d7a99239feba38d6fff3f31bb007f9d6a061",
      "target": "“So, what's the situation?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17487",
      "source_sha256": "4e16c0fe954952f2b729e3fb55a6ef42bbcab8aefa6fe2bea702658154bbe422",
      "target": "“They're starting to get serious. Instead of the security forces they used to send<STOP>to put down riots, they're apparently forming proper units<STOP>to deal with organized resistance. And the Specials have had their authority expanded<STOP>after their recent successes hunting guerrillas.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17488",
      "source_sha256": "dd893c33155a94fbbec4246a2705b1918c73acedb3f800649671368158dd00fb",
      "target": "“Hmm. The Specials are an Earthling force believed to have been<STOP>organized by the Romefeller Foundation, correct?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17489",
      "source_sha256": "c3fbf2b313c3fbe2470b0ad79dded315cdd693af4bc8598bcb3be762deebfdb4",
      "target": "“Unforgivable. Both Romefeller and the Specials<STOP>are doing all this to protect their own interests,<STOP>committing such atrocities against their fellow Earthlings.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17490",
      "source_sha256": "dc8ce669db0bddd5ecd747a077962170893b8af33c7f15f1243cf4a9803aee79",
      "target": "“As long as the Empire rules us,<STOP>there are only three kinds of Earthlings.<STOP>Those who obey the Empire and keep their heads down to survive,<STOP>those who help it, and those who fight it.<STOP>What a miserable time to be alive.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17491",
      "source_sha256": "6f123888d4b55903035c2671c0bb2ec6f1c2e15b9bc4ea0885f65ba2d86d6f05",
      "target": "“Lady Simone...”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17492",
      "source_sha256": "9a572e4ddd407afded897f2b0da8cc1dd61fefb4d962af31bbffa49c3a82739c",
      "target": "“Let's drop the ‘Lady.’ It never suited me anyway.<STOP>We're both just members of the resistance now.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17493",
      "source_sha256": "0c28c30633e9d510cc8af5273c3f0b6b67e9ae0db062288f39bfebee93e9158c",
      "target": "“But if that's how the Imperial forces are responding,<STOP>things are going to get much harder...<STOP>Well, we'd better get moving. Right now, our priority<STOP>is to gather enough fighting strength as quickly as possible.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17494",
      "source_sha256": "7fe8b051b7e8bf11dd5e7008cfbaf08b45d8800b4b34b8238cb2dd93407b0e33",
      "target": "“Where are we going, then?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17495",
      "source_sha256": "1d275400d04d338fb9421a05c84eb3e37932d9f35f627e28423674f42f821a6e",
      "target": "“First, we'll visit one of the scientists whose research<STOP>Karaba is supporting.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17496",
      "source_sha256": "997c793349708dd19b3b90cdb3d4a9e0e6f4247d0625cfa50ba931429d12715b",
      "target": "“Karaba... That's the anti-Imperial group you organized, right?<STOP>So you support research, too?”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17497",
      "source_sha256": "3351b071c4673d8e454437975255b47131098301013931cc4f32e35e56510424",
      "target": "“Scientists, particularly those working on military technology<STOP>or energy research that could have military applications,<STOP>are likely to attract the Empire's attention.<STOP>There are also a few engineers from the former Western Federation,<STOP>but most of these scientists originally had their research facilities<STOP>in the Japan region.<STOP>Before the Muge Zorbados Empire occupied it, we helped them<STOP>relocate to various places.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17498",
      "source_sha256": "e5fa50b7e78cbe33295832bc7207aef25014563a8087b7e452607e243f95b250",
      "target": "“I see.<STOP>So that's how you were able to build an Earth-made SPT like the Doll.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "key": "base:t00_17499",
      "source_sha256": "b5122efa1a29bad4981ca6285045ddc2cce91ad25042694909796eb1d4470bd5",
      "target": "“Exactly.”<END>",
      "review_status": "draft"
    },
    {
